  "description": "v023's exact recipe (hidden 128, 225,922 params, his architecture, his model as teacher) with his FULL training schedule: batch 64 and 5 epochs instead of 3. Two variables changed from v023, both from his notes, and both now affordable because batch 64 trains 2.2x faster than batch 16.",
